// Personal records (spec P9: rewards are personal records on the scoreboard only). The only records are the
// best week of two learning measures; there is nothing for showing up, time spent or work finished.

// The best week of retention among the last `score_weeks` weeks ending at now: its accuracy and attempts. A
// week counts only with at least `score_minimum` retention attempts; none that do is sample 0, enough 0.
score_record_retention(Score_table score_table_in, word score_now, int score_weeks, int score_minimum) {
  Score_figures score_weekly = score_retention_trend(score_table_in, score_now, score_weeks, score_minimum);
  Score_figure score_result = score_best(score_weekly);
} return Score_figure score_result;
